    "selected_changes": [
      "Subsidence of remembered material positions uses physical lateral coordinates.",
      "Infeasible indivisible thrust matching uses a conservative capacity fallback with exact binary bulk lengths.",
      "Positive thin constituents retain exact interval ownership through slicing and rasterization; complete binary support expansions stay inside one physical parcel.",
